  "content": "\n\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>目前支援的模組：</strong></span></h1>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-energistics-2-wireless-terminals\" rel=\"nofollow\">AE2WLIB</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ex-pattern-provider\" rel=\"nofollow\">Extended AE</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-flux\" rel=\"nofollow\">Applied Flux</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ae2-import-export-card\" rel=\"nofollow\">AE2 Import Export Card</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mega-cells\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MEGA Cells</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advancedae\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AdvancedAE</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/merequester\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ME Requester</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>這些紋理並非全部由我製作，我使用了來自&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ae2-blackout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AE2 Blackout</a></p>\n<p>並為我們社群中的女孩們將其重新設計成粉紅色。</p>",
